# Repository shellcheck configuration. Its presence stops shellcheck from
# falling back to a personal ~/.shellcheckrc, so scripts/check_shell.sh
# applies the same rules on a laptop as in CI.
#
# It carries no disable= entries: an entry here would apply to every shell
# script in the repository. Accepted patterns are excluded on their own line,
# next to the code, with the reason (see scripts/check_shell.sh).
